1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,670
Renewable energy is becoming one of the most important solutions for a sustainable future.

2
00:00:06,670 --> 00:00:15,310
Solar panels, wind turbines, and hydroelectric power generate electricity while reducing carbon emissions.

3
00:00:15,310 --> 00:00:24,140
Countries around the world are investing in clean energy to protect the environment and reduce dependence on fossil fuels.

4
00:00:24,140 --> 00:00:33,000
With continued innovation and global cooperation, renewable energy can power future generations safely and efficiently.

